Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:05.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I got you a present!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:05.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮你们准备了一份礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:09.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my goodness, where did you hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:09.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你之前把它藏在哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:11.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got it for your wedding and I ordered it weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:11.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我几周前订了当做你们结婚的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it finally got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在终于送来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:14.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, you didn't have to get us anything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:14.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你不必送我们结婚礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:15.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}for our wedding you already sang...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:15.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你已经唱过...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:18.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love it! It's huge! Let's open it! Let's open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:18.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢  好大啊  快打开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:25.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} It's a Ms. PacMan machine!  Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:25.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是"吃豆小姐"的游戏机  我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't know where to put it, so I just left it here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道该放到哪里  就暂时放在客厅了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:31.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} We can put it in the guest bedroom.  Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:31.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以把它放在客房  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:37.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I kind of like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:37.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得放在这里挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you really like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you kidding?! I practically spent my entire childhood at the arcade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开什么玩笑  我小时候整天待在游乐场里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:45.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is like...Oh my, this is like my second favorite game!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:45.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我第二喜欢的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? What's your first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最喜欢什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't remember the name of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我记不得名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:49.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what did it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:49.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}内容是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:53.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd put a quarter in, pull some handles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:53.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把铜板放进去  拉把手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and win a candy bar or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就能拿到糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:57.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A vending machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:57.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自动贩卖机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:01:00.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't feel bad for me. I won every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:01:00.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别可怜我  每次我都会赢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E12 The One Where Joey Dates Rachel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第12集  乔伊和瑞秋约会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:43.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm so glad you guys are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:43.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很高兴你们都在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been dying to tell someone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我等不及要告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}what happened in the paleontology department today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}古生物系今天的新闻了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.10,0:01:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think he saw us, or can we still slip out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.10,0:01:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得他看到了我们吗  还有机会溜走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Professor Newman, the department head, is retiring, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}系主任诺曼教授要退休了  所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They made you head of the department!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你升职系主任了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.96,0:01:59.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I get to teach one of his advanced classes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.96,0:01:59.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我要接手他其中一门高级课
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:03.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why didn't I get head of the department?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:03.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为什么没当上系主任
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.49,0:02:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Rach, listen, I got a big date coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.49,0:02:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  我有个重要约会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:10.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know a good restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:10.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道哪家餐厅不错吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:15.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Paul's Cafe. It's got great food and it's really romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:15.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保罗餐厅  那里东西好吃  气氛又很浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:17.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:17.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then afterward you can take her to the Four Seasons for drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后带她到四季饭店喝东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:24.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or go downtown and listen to some jazz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:24.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是到城里听爵士乐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:27.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or dancing. Oh, take her dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:27.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是跳舞  带她去跳舞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:30.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You sure are naming a lot of ways to postpone sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:30.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的很会拖延性爱的进度
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I miss dating. Getting all dressed up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怀念约会的感觉  可以盛装打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and going to a fancy restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去高级餐厅吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:39.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I won't be able to do that for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:39.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很久都没法再出去约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:41.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it's so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:41.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not that sitting at home worrying about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实坐在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:46.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}giving birth to a sixteen pound baby is not fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:46.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}担心生孩子的事也挺有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you know what? Why don't I take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧  我带你出去约会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:55.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Joey, you don't want to date a pregnant lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:55.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  你可不想跟孕妇约会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:58.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I do. We're gonna go out, we're gonna have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:58.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我愿意  我们就出去好好享受一番
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:03:02.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll take your mind off of childbirth, and Csections...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:03:02.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会让你忘了生孩子  剖腹产
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and gaint baby heads stretching out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝宝的头撑大...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:07.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'll go with you. I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:07.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我答应你  我跟你去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.51,0:03:09.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} It will be fun.  All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.51,0:03:09.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会很好玩的  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.97,0:03:12.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.97,0:03:12.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要  太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:15.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you look at that, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:15.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快来看啊  莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just knocked off all your top scores. How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打败了你的最佳成绩  真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't start another game. I'm next! Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再开始新一盘了  轮到我了  菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, I couldn't hear you over all the winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我赢得太开心  听不到你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, Phoebe's hogging the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比在霸占游戏机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who cares? It's a stupid game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至于吗  不过是个愚蠢的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:34.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You only think it's stupid because you suck at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:34.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得它蠢是因为你玩得太逊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:37.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't suck. It sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:37.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不逊  是游戏太逊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你才逊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait okay, if this game
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果这个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:45.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is gonna cause problems between the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:45.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会惹得你们俩闹别扭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:46.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}then maybe I should just keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:46.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我还是自己留着玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:49.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I love it. It is a great present.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:49.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我喜欢它  这个礼物棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:52.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In fact, why don't you go home and wait for the thankyou card?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:52.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不回家等我给你寄感谢贺卡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you want to play this game so badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么这么想玩这个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:58.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah! It's not like it spits out a Clark bar after every game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:58.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  又不是每玩完一盘就往外吐糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:01.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Phoebe, that's it. Come on, out of the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:01.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  菲比  够了  快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. Come on, out of the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点  快点  起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:06.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:06.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:12.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, could you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:12.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  麻烦你去开门
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:18.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:18.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:28.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought you were in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:28.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你在房里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:30.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm picking you up for our date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:30.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是来接你去约会的
