Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:59.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得加上一句"真是太不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:02.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just want to have a normal life!"
