Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:25.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们走到门口时...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:30.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I lightly press my lips against his.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:30.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会将我的嘴唇轻轻压在他的嘴唇上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then move into his body, just for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将身体靠向他  停留一秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:37.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then I make this sound:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:37.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我会发出这样的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:46.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't sound like anything, but I swear it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:46.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来没什么  但很有效
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. That would work, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  的确有效
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.85,0:13:54.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I gotta go to bed. Honey. I had such a wonderful time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.85,0:13:54.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我得睡了 我今晚玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:02.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:02.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:17.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were 50 minutes late to the class, what did you crawl there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:17.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你上课迟到了50分钟  你是用爬的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I ran, okay? It's really far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我用跑的  真的很远
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:22.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did people stop understanding
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:22.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在的人怎么都听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:24.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the phrase "Get the hell out of my way"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:24.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"别挡我的路"呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:27.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why didn't you take a cab?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:27.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不搭计程车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Between the traffic that time of day and all the oneway streets
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}塞车太严重  还净是单行道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:32.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}it'd take me twice as long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:32.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搭计程车得花两倍的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Besides, I teach the class three times a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再说  我一星期有三堂课
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:36.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who am I, Rockefeller?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:36.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以为我是富家子弟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:40.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You won't be able to keep doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:40.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能再继续这样下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:44.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to. If I don't, they'll take the class away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:44.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没办法  不然他们会取消我这堂课
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I put it in my family newsletter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经把这条新闻登在我家的通讯报上了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Your what?  You've seen it, The Geller Yeller.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  你看过的  《盖勒通讯报》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:56.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:56.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:00.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I figured out a much faster route.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:00.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想出一条比较快的路线
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure I can make it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我敢说这次我能及时赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:06.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just can't be afraid to get a little bit hit by cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:06.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是我不能害怕被车子撞到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:15.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember last night when we talked about Cujo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:15.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得昨晚我们谈过《狂犬惊魂记》吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:17.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I still can't believe you haven't seen Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:17.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信你没看过《狂犬惊魂记》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.53,0:15:18.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.53,0:15:18.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真搞不懂你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:20.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Relax, it's not like it's Citizen Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:20.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至于吗  那又不是《公民凯恩》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.95,0:15:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you ever sat through Citizen Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.95,0:15:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看完了《公民凯恩》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:27.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it's really boring. But it's, like, a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:27.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  真的很无聊  但那可是经典
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I was thinking about renting Cujo sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之  我想去租《狂犬惊魂记》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:34.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, all right. Well, let's do it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:34.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今晚一起看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:38.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Don't you have that big date tonight?  Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:38.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是有约会吗  对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:41.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hey, Joey, can I ask you something?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:41.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  我能问你一件事吗  问吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:45.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After our date last night, did you feel a little weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:45.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚约会后  你有没有觉得怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. You did too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你也是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:50.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It totally freaked me out. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:50.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我吓坏了  那是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:51.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:51.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:55.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm kind of thinking it was the lobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:55.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得应该是龙虾的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:01.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Yeah, the lobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:01.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊  龙虾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:05.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I was up sick all night.  Me too. All night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:05.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我吐了一整晚  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:08.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? How come we didn't cross paths?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:08.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  那我怎么没看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  那是因为
