Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都待在房里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.09,0:16:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't want to look in my hamper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.09,0:16:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的洗衣篮惨不忍睹
