Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:58.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很厉害  但那是要付出代价的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:02.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ben's coming over tonight, and he can't see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:02.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本今晚要过来  不能让他看到这些
