Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, why don't you all start to read while I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请大家先看一会书  我要...
