Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没事吗  你似乎有点心不在焉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:12.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, I'm fine. It's just...
