Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:18.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you ever looked at someone you know for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:18.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有这样的经验  看着你熟悉的人...
