Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you know exactly what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你完全了解我的意思
